<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12626"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 04, 2005 - 6:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://groups-beta.google.com/group/rec.autos.marketplace/browse_thread/thread/b73c4b98501ce641/fdb57d4a70269d03?q=&amp;rnum=4#fdb57d4a70269d03" target=_top>http://groups-beta.google.com/group/rec.autos.mark etplace/browse_thread/thread/b73c4b98501ce641/fdb5 7d4a70269d03?q=&amp;rnum=4#fdb57d4a70269d03</a> <BR> <BR>OK, this is boring, but it is definately posted by <BR>denny himself. I am sure because the same email addy was used by someone with a nick of &#34;K&#34; under a religious group, and a &#34;Brian Rader&#34; with a sick <BR>squirrel. If I could see the whole email addy, I could do a search for that, but I dont know how to get it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
