<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12627"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hmmm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 04, 2005 - 7:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If that was really dennis rader, then he posted this also... <BR> <BR><a href="http://groups-beta.google.com/group/alt.org.promisekeepers/browse_thread/thread/ad24f1a7398c568f/0b7fd0cb129a3bed?q=&amp;rnum=1#0b7fd0cb129a3bed" target=_top>http://groups-beta.google.com/group/alt.org.promis ekeepers/browse_thread/thread/ad24f1a7398c568f/0b7 fd0cb129a3bed?q=&amp;rnum=1#0b7fd0cb129a3bed</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
