<!--Post: 12628--><!--Time: 1112625466-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12628"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hmmm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 04, 2005 - 7:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Duh, you said that already.  I must be tired... <BR> <BR>I wonder why the use of Brian and K?  I forgot, what is his son&#39;s name?  Is it possible that his children were using this account?  I don&#39;t know how we can be sure it&#39;s him.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
