<!--Post: 12635--><!--Time: 1112648106-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12635"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jed4258<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jed4258<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 04, 2005 - 1:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Southwind.net is a ISP from the Wichita area, also yhas become a part of earthlink.net <BR>So, my bet is this was his post.   <BR>Also frmo the looks of it he was a member of the Promisekeepers<!--/Text--></td></tr>
